\p
\v 1 Then I turned and \add ≈looked up¦377566\add* and wow, I saw¦377568 four¦377570 chariots¦377571 coming¦377572 out from¦377573 between¦377573 two¦377574 bronze¦377578 mountains.
\v 2 The¦377581 first¦377581 chariot¦377580 \add was being pulled by\add* red horses, the¦377585 second¦377585 by black¦377587 horses,\x + \xo 6:2: a \xt Rev 6:4; \xo b \xt Rev 6:5.\x*
\v 3 the third¦377590 by white¦377592 horses, and¦377589 the fourth¦377594 by \add ≈spotted grey\add* horses.\x + \xo 6:3: \xt Rev 6:2.\x*
\p
\v 4 I \add ≈asked\add* the¦377603 messenger¦377603 who¦377604 had talked with¦377605 me¦377605, “What¦377606 are¦377608 those¦377608, my¦377609 master¦377609?”
\v 5 “Those are¦377616 four¦377616 winds¦377617 of the heavens¦377618 that¦377619 go¦377619 out from¦377620 where they were, ahead of the master¦377623 of the whole¦377624 world,” he answered¦377611.\x + \xo 6:5: \xt Rev 7:1.\x*
\v 6 “The¦377631 chariot pulled by black¦377632 horses will go north¦377637, the one pulled by white¦377638 horses will go west, and¦377643 the one pulled by \add ≈spotted grey\add* horses will go south¦377648.”
\v 7 The¦377650 strong¦377650 \add ?horses¦377650\add* went out¦377651 and wanted¦377652 to go and roam over the earth, and he¦377657 said¦377657, “Go and roam over the earth.” and they¦377661 went to roam over the earth.
\v 8 Then¦377664 \add @the messenger\add* called¦377664 out and¦377664 told me, “Look at the ones that¦377670 are¦377670 going¦377670 out to¦377671 the north country. They¦377675 will¦377670 appease my¦377678 spirit¦377678 in¦377679 the north country.”
\s1 The crowning of Yehoshua
