\p
\v 9 Then Yahweh's¦377686 message¦377684 \add came\add* to¦377687 me¦377687, saying¦377688,
\v 10 “Take¦377690 \add the offering\add* from the exiles¦377692 that Heldai¦377693, Toviyah¦377695, and Yedayah¦377697 \add are bringing\add*, and go this same day¦377700 and take it into Yoshiyah's¦377704 house¦377703 (Tsefanyah's¦377707 son¦377705, who¦377708 has¦377710 come¦377710 from Babylon¦377711).
\v 11 Then¦377713 take¦377713 the gold¦377716 and silver¦377714, and make¦377717 a crown¦377718 and place it on¦377720 the head¦377720 of the high¦377726 priest¦377725, Yehoshua¦377721 (Yehotsadak's¦377724 son¦377722)
