\v 13 Then¦379146 Yahweh told me¦379148, “Give the \add ≈money\add* to the potter\f + \fr 11:13 \ft potter (following the Hebrew): in the ancient Syriac translation, they used ‘treasury’ (2x) in this verse, so some other English translations might differ.\f*—the \add ≈pathetic amount that¦379155 they valued¦379156 you at\add*.” So¦379146 I¦379156 took¦379158 the thirty¦379159 silver¦379160 \add ≈coins\add* and¦379146 tossed them¦379157 to the potter in Yahweh's¦379147 \add ≈temple\add*.
\v 14 Then¦379169 I broke¦379169 my¦379172 second¦379173 staff¦379172 \add named\add* ‘Unity’ to¦379176 break¦379176 the¦379179 brotherhood¦379179 between¦379180 Yehudah¦379181 and¦379182 Yisrael¦379183.
