\v 16 because¦379197 listen, I'm¦379200 about¦379201 to¦379201 set a shepherd¦379202 in place in the land who won't care for \add ≈those¦379204 who are dying\add*. He won't seek¦379211 out the sheep gone missing, nor will¦379204 he heal¦379214 the crippled sheep. He won't feed the sheep that¦379204 are healthy¦379215, but¦379212 he'll¦379207 tear¦379222 off the hooves¦379221 of¦379218 the fattened sheep and¦379221 \add ≈eat¦379220 them for meat¦379218\add*.
